According to the guidelines, for the low-rainfall cover, the maximum payout per hectare is as follows: 
for the first phase, from mid-July to August, the payout is 3600 Rs/Hectare when the consecutive dry days are between Strike 4 and Exit, 
and for the last phase, in October, the payout is also 3600 Rs/Hectare when the consecutive dry days are between Strike 4 and Exit.
